// Saltwright hull-shrine (save point): a carved prow on a mourning-hull, with lamps hung for the drowned. Not the Order's; it answers in every state.
title: ch15_shrine_hollowmere
location: ch15/hollowmere
---
A carved prow on an old hull, hung with small lamps, one for each of Hollowmere's drowned. Somebody keeps them trimmed. Nobody here asks whether you're inside the Level. #line:ch15_shrine_001 #narration #long
===
